<h2>What is welcome</h2>
<p>You can talk, vent, find company, or discuss a shared topic. Astrology and tarot are for reflection and entertainment. They do not promise an outcome.</p>
<h2>What is not allowed</h2>
<ul><li>Sexual or suggestive talk, abuse, threats, or harassment.</li><li>Asking for or sharing phone numbers, social accounts, addresses, or private contact details.</li><li>Asking for money, selling services, or arranging meetings.</li><li>Pretending to be someone else or claiming false qualifications.</li><li>Using the service if you are under 18.</li><li>Making your own recording of the other person.</li></ul>
<h2>What happens after a breach</h2>
<p>We may end the call and issue a strike. Three strikes mean a permanent ban and forfeiture of the wallet balance, subject to applicable law. Serious threats or illegal content may be referred to the police. Serious breaches may lead to immediate account action.</p>
<p>Hosts also follow the <a href="/hosts/rules">host rules</a>. If something feels wrong, end the call and <a href="/report">report it</a>. Give the call ID and explain what happened. You can challenge account action through the <a href="/grievance">grievance process</a>.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
